+
+# Validate task input
+
+Reject invalid input with an `invalid-input` error whose message says what is wrong, when a task is
+added, renamed or tagged. Nothing in the list changes on rejection.
+
+- Title: empty or only spaces, or longer than 120 characters (after trimming).
+- Priority: anything but `low`, `normal`, `high`.
+- Tag: empty or containing a space.
+
+Done in `src/domain/task.ts` (validators) and `src/domain/list.ts` (`add`, `rename`, `tag`), with tests.
